# ...but OUR OWN router head is a submission deliverable, not bulk weights: 17 KB
# against the 21.8M-parameter expert checkpoints this rule exists to exclude.
# Judges must be able to load the model that produced the reported number.
!results/router-fitting-v2/router.pt
# R1 (Codex review 2026-08-29): configs/predict.yaml points at these, so a clean
# clone cannot run the system we describe unless they are tracked. Both are our
# own small owned weights, not bulk model files.
!results/router-fitting-v2/router_reliability.pt
!results/degradation/classifier.pt
*.ckpt
